From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: isolate PON diagnostic learning and LAN1 bind in PPE1

Keep PPE2 (bank 1) disabled during PON diagnostic learning and bound
forwarding so GDM2 ingress frames always miss PPE2 and enter IFC/NPU
authorization intact. Isolate PON learning and the single static LAN1
bound row in PPE1 (bank 0), where NPU reinjects authorized PON frames via
PSE 4. Drain, clear, verify SRAM ack/readback, and restore both banks on
close and release while excluding ordinary host commits to bank 0.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -944,8 +944,10 @@
